      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I encountered this issue when serializing a DataDictionary with VRCJson and synchronizing strings (World SDK 3.8.2).\n\nIn my test case, about 10% of the Minify JSON string was this unnecessary space, and removing it would reduce the amount of synchronized data.\n\nSince properly removing spaces from JSON strings with Udon requires consideration of \"spaces in strings enclosed in double quotes,\" it would be very helpful if the Minify option could remove the spaces.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
